      <methods>
         <methodStep>
            <description>
               <para>The polygons for each site were created by the Information Manager (IM) of that site and thus vary somewhat among polygons. Some sites' boundaries are a simple rectangular bounding box while others are more precise. If more specific provenance is needed for a particular site or sites, please use the LTER Network directory (https://lternet.edu/directory/) to identify the IM of the relevant site(s).</para>
            </description>
         </methodStep>
      </methods>
